# Charged ollie, 360 Flip (J + down left, then J again: the THPS 1+2 double tap on the Varial Kickflip's
# slot; it was J + up right before 2026-11-16, which THPS 1+2 gives the Inward Heelflip) right after the
# pop: the flip finishes and the combo lands (the view's flip review: ./skate strip --sheet scenarios/tricks.strips).
park lab
spawn lab_ledge
hold up 0..60
hold ollie 60..90
tap flip+down+left 96
tap flip 99
run 300
expect event trickStart{trick=360 Flip} within 100..100
expect event trickEnd{trick=360 Flip} within 120..170
expect event comboLanded{name=360 Flip,points=500} within 160..240
expect no event bail
